## Aim for Day 1
The aim of Day 1 was to restart preprocessing from the correct continuous SPM dataset, rebuild the epoched dataset using the correct trial window, and complete preprocessing up to the end of first-pass visual quality control.

## Starting point
The existing epoched file (`espmeeg_sub-2247A_ses-0001_task-attnmod_run-01_meg.mat`) was not used because it had been created with the wrong epoch window. Preprocessing was therefore restarted from the continuous converted SPM file:

- `spmeeg_sub-2247A_ses-0001_task-attnmod_run-01_meg.mat`

